  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Three charges are placed at the three vertices of an equilateral triangle of side <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;as shown in the figure. The force experienced by the charge placed at the vertex <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> in a direction normal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> is</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/8e9baabd-eb7a-44a9-8fdc-f4f176b3ecf0-image.png\" style=\"width: 240px; height: 185px;\" /></p>",
