  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Resultant force</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>F</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>F</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>120</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>120</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/2ca33903-5b85-4ca6-a0d8-ece8058f4f1e-image.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 220px;\" /></p><p>Now, from figure</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo>&#39;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>F</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><msup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></msqrt></math></p><p>Now, the force normal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> at vertex <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo>&#39;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><msup><mi>F</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
